{"item_id": "73649a61bb7c5818", "kind": "post", "source_id": "bilibili", "source_name": "B站", "title": "两个月做了20+个App：我的AI App工厂是怎么跑起来的？【B站AI创造公开赛】", "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1EagM6SEHN", "project_url": null, "author": "MakerJackie", "author_url": "https://space.bilibili.com/39823137", "published_at": "2026-08-15T01:02:02+08:00", "captured_at": "2026-09-22T13:08:31+08:00", "lang": "zh", "body": "这两个月我做了 20 多个 iOS App，也做了一些小程序和网站。\n\n这期视频主要复盘一下我是怎么做的：从多台电脑并行跑 AI Agent，到代码模板、Harness、MCP、Skills，再到把调研、设计、开发、测试和上架逐渐做成一套自动化流程。\n\n最近 30 天大约消耗了 741 亿 Token，实际每个月 AI 订阅和工具支出大概 4000～5000 元。目前 iOS App 总下载 3000+，收入约 100 美元；《世界的形状》上线后也获得了一些用户和 Token 赞助。\n\n做东西的速度确实越", "body_format": "text", "comments": [], "comments_total": 0, "comments_truncated": false, "metrics": {"play": 19216, "danmaku": 6, "favorites": 1751}, "tags": ["B站AI创造公开赛", "APP", "人工智能", "软件", "工厂"], "links": [], "discovered_via": "bili:独立开发", "extra": {"bvid": "BV1EagM6SEHN", "query": "独立开发", "project_url_rejected": "讨论页/聚合站/文档站｜https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1EagM6SEHN", "layer": "signal"}, "body_completeness": "metadata_only", "record_type": "update", "run_id": "20260922T130556"}
{"item_id": "187a6e618d5477b7", "kind": "post", "source_id": "bilibili", "source_name": "B站", "title": "游戏开发的七宗罪（会毁掉你的梦想游戏） - Sebbyspoons - Game Dev and Pixel Art - 中配", "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1bfeS61EWT", "project_url": null, "author": "旁白_B", "author_url": "https://space.bilibili.com/335691338", "published_at": "2026-09-19T05:52:26+08:00", "captured_at": "2026-09-22T13:08:31+08:00", "lang": "zh", "body": "独立开发者 Sebby 以“七宗罪”盘点单人做游戏常踩的坑：反复换引擎、功能范围失控、用美术关卡逃避核心循环、追爆款类型、过度打磨、被新点子带偏。他建议把范围写在便利贴上，先做丑陋但可玩的原型，提前定可发布标准，坚持核心玩法，收尾时砍掉不必要内容，否则项目容易卡住并夭折。\n----------------------------------------------------------------\n00:00:00 引言\n00:00:26 罪7：嫉妒\n00:01:45 罪6：暴食\n00:03:40 罪5", "body_format": "text", "comments": [], "comments_total": 0, "comments_truncated": false, "metrics": {"play": 8934, "danmaku": 15, "favorites": 596}, "tags": ["游戏开发", "旁白_B", "Godot 4", "Godot", "Unreal Engine", "Unity", "双语", "中配"], "links": [], "discovered_via": "bili:独立开发", "extra": {"bvid": "BV1bfeS61EWT", "query": "独立开发", "project_url_rejected": "讨论页/聚合站/文档站｜https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1bfeS61EWT", "layer": "signal"}, "body_completeness": "metadata_only", "record_type": "update", "run_id": "20260922T130556"}
